local drivers of u.a: port a
local loads of u.a: cont assign to n, terminal 2 of g1
local drivers of u.n: cont assign to n
local loads of u.n: cont assign to y, terminal 1 of g1
local drivers of u.y: cont assign to y
local loads of u.y: port y
local drivers of u.z: port z, terminal 0 of g1
local loads of u.z: port z
while in effect
  drivers of ftgt: cont assign to ftgt, force
  loads of fsrc: assign stmt, force
  port o among the drivers of tq: 1
after release and deassign
  drivers of ftgt: cont assign to ftgt
  loads of fsrc: none
  port o among the drivers of tq: 1
